    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatdown City Survivors is a tense and exhilarating immersive sandbox survive-em-up  that knocks the genre on its head! The city is a nightmarish playground of interactive elements, including gas to ignite, puddles to electrify, and cars to blow up. Find dozens of weapons, including pipes, pigeons, boots, and combine them to make bigger, better and funnier  weapons! You'll need to make your ultimate build and manipulate every element possible to wipe out the gruesome zombies, mutants and blood- thirsty creatures lurking in the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=696 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=590 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Survival!\u00a0</strong>Experience time survival gameplay fused with immersive sim sandbox (lite) gameplay for the first time! Destroy the environment, mix elements, set traps, and use anything to build own play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create wild weapon combos!</strong> Strap knives to slippers and shred hundreds of fiends or make a bazooka out of fireworks and a pipe to blow up everything in sight. Experiment to uncover fun new combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for your life!</strong> Use a large array of distinct automated combos made of punches, kicks, uppercuts, drop kicks, ground slams and a whole lot more to fight your your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and play as new survivors!</strong> Build your army with an eclectic group of fighters who all have their own attacks and specials. They include include martial arts masters, shouting socialites, cats, and even a high top wearing Shiba Inu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Conquer!</strong> Unlock &gt;100 weapons and passives to create the ultimate build! Earn cash during runs, and buy upgrades to increase your chance of survival.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The City is Yours!</strong> Fight through the desolate streets of Times Square, a zoo filled with mutant animals, and dank subway tunnels filled with speeding trains and hidden terrors. Battle monstrous bosses including a cyborg wrestler, vampire bikers, an ice troll in yoga pants, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/92f5811e38c353d10401578f3f803ae3.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatdown City Survivors is a tense and exhilarating immersive sandbox survive-em-up  that knocks the genre on its head! The city is a nightmarish playground of interactive elements, including gas to ignite, puddles to electrify, and cars to blow up. Find dozens of weapons, including pipes, pigeons, boots, and combine them to make bigger, better and funnier  weapons! You'll need to make your ultimate build and manipulate every element possible to wipe out the gruesome zombies, mutants and blood- thirsty creatures lurking in the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=696 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/4f59f05284805fdf38bb0ec00d410151.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.poster.avif?t=1753036114\" width=590 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.webm?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/extras/da6f0890219d6acf4cf0a5b8c5979701.mp4?t=1753036114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Survival!\u00a0</strong>Experience time survival gameplay fused with immersive sim sandbox (lite) gameplay for the first time! Destroy the environment, mix elements, set traps, and use anything to build own play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create wild weapon combos!</strong> Strap knives to slippers and shred hundreds of fiends or make a bazooka out of fireworks and a pipe to blow up everything in sight. Experiment to uncover fun new combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for your life!</strong> Use a large array of distinct automated combos made of punches, kicks, uppercuts, drop kicks, ground slams and a whole lot more to fight your your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and play as new survivors!</strong> Build your army with an eclectic group of fighters who all have their own attacks and specials. They include include martial arts masters, shouting socialites, cats, and even a high top wearing Shiba Inu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Conquer!</strong> Unlock &gt;100 weapons and passives to create the ultimate build! Earn cash during runs, and buy upgrades to increase your chance of survival.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The City is Yours!</strong> Fight through the desolate streets of Times Square, a zoo filled with mutant animals, and dank subway tunnels filled with speeding trains and hidden terrors. Battle monstrous bosses including a cyborg wrestler, vampire bikers, an ice troll in yoga pants, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Eradicate hordes of nuclear monsters in this immersive sandbox survival roguelite. Everything is your weapon, from knives, pipes &amp; pigeons, to crafted weapons &amp; even the environment! Break everything, ignite gas, electrify water, you name it. Upgrade yourself, your base, your team, &amp; survive!",
